 SG_ B0 : 0|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" HOST
 SG_ B1 : 8|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" HOST
 SG_ B2 : 16|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" HOST
 SG_ B3 : 24|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" HOST
 SG_ B4 : 32|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" HOST
 SG_ B5 : 40|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" HOST
 SG_ B6 : 48|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" HOST
 SG_ B7 : 56|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" HOST

BO_ 2560688129 IoT_To_BMS_Config: 8 IOT
 SG_ Cmd : 0|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" BMS
