 SG_ BMS_Version : 0|16@1+ (1,0) [0|65535] "" HOST
 SG_ IoT_Version : 16|16@1+ (1,0) [0|65535] "" HOST
 SG_ MQTT_Connected : 32|8@1+ (1,0) [0|1] "" HOST
 SG_ Partition_ID : 40|8@1+ (1,0) [0|2] "" HOST

